<title>ITALY: Parmalat launches 200 billion lire bond.</title>
<headline>Parmalat launches 200 billion lire bond.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's largest quoted food group Parmalat Finanziaria said on Tuesday it will launch a 10-year 200 billion lire bond to replace short-term debt with longer term paper.</p>
<p>The bond is aimed at Italian professsional investors and is being organised by investment bank UBS in London. The bond will be launched on January 2, 1997 and cover the 10-year period to January 2, 2007.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +329 66129502</p>
